{
  "metadata": {
    "title": "The Gambler",
    "author": "Dostoyevsky, Fyodor, 1821-1881",
    "releaseDate": null,
    "language": null,
    "originalPublication": null,
    "credits": null
  },
  "content": {
    "chapters": [
      {
        "number": 1,
        "title": "",
        "sections": [
          {
            "text": "",
            "beats": [
              {
                "text": "The Gambler, by Fyodor Dostoyevsky.",
                "beat_type": "book_title_announcement",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Chapter One.",
                "beat_type": "chapter_announcement",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "At length I returned from two weeks leave of absence to find that my patrons had arrived three days ago in Roulettenberg.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I received from them a welcome quite different to that which I had expected.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "The General eyed me coldly, greeted me in rather haughty fashion, and dismissed me to pay my respects to his sister.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I was assigned a small room on the fourth floor of the hotel, for you must know that I belonged to the General's suite.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Finally his anger exploded, and he added sharply:",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I suppose you would like to take them to the Casino to play roulette? Well, excuse my speaking so plainly, but I know how addicted you are to gambling.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "sharp irritation",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I have no money for gambling.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "quiet",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I quietly replied.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "But you will soon be in receipt of some.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "retorting",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Retorted the General.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Let us calculate.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "businesslike",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "He went on.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "We must translate these roubles into thalers. Here, take 100 thalers, as a round sum. The rest will be safe in my hands.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "businesslike",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I accepted the money without a word, and then withdrew to my own room.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "On the way I met Polina Alexandrovna on the staircase.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I have been waiting for you.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:polina_alexandrovna",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "composed",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "She said.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Come to my room.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:polina_alexandrovna",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "composed",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I followed her in silence.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:narrator",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              }
            ],
            "section_type": null
          }
        ],
        "ambient_audio_paths": [],
        "sfx_audio_paths": [],
        "music_audio_paths": []
      },
      {
        "number": 6,
        "title": "",
        "sections": [
          {
            "text": "",
            "beats": [
              {
                "text": "Chapter Six.",
                "beat_type": "chapter_announcement",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I stepped from the path into the carriage-way, and took my stand in the middle of it. There I awaited the Baron and the Baroness.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "When they were but a few paces distant from me I took off my hat, and bowed.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Madame la Baronne, j'ai l'honneur d'être votre esclave.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "loud and distinct",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Said I, loudly and distinctly.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Hein!",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:baron_burmergelm",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "angry surprise",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Ejaculated, or rather growled, the Baron as he turned towards me in angry surprise.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Ja wohl!",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "defiant",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I replied, still looking him in the eyes.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Sind Sie rasend?",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:baron_burmergelm",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "furious",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "He exclaimed, brandishing his stick.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I have perpetrated the piece of idiocy.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "flat",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I said as I came level with her.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Have you? Then you can take the consequences.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_baroness",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "cold dismissal",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "She replied without so much as looking at me.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "My good sir.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "measured",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "The General began.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "May I ask you what this is that you have gone and done?",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "reproachful",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I should be glad.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "calm",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I replied.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "If we could come straight to the point. Probably you are referring to my encounter of today with a German?",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "calm",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "With a German? Why, the German was the Baron Burmergelm, a most important personage! I hear that you have been rude both to him and to the Baroness?",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "indignant",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "No, I have not.",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "flat",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "I replied.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "For God's sake, Alexis Ivanovitch, do put an end to this senseless scheme of yours!",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "entreaty",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "He muttered, but with a sudden change from a truculent tone to one of entreaty as he caught me by the hand.",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "With that he wound up in a despairing voice:",
                "beat_type": "narration",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:alexis_ivanovitch",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "neutral",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              },
              {
                "text": "O Alexis Ivanovitch, Alexis Ivanovitch!",
                "beat_type": "dialogue",
                "character_id": "the_gambler:fyodor_dostoyevsky:the_general",
                "scene_id": null,
                "emotion": "despairing",
                "voice_stability": null,
                "voice_style": null,
                "voice_speed": null
              }
            ],
            "section_type": null
          }
        ],
        "ambient_audio_paths": [],
        "sfx_audio_paths": [],
        "music_audio_paths": []
      }
    ]
